    * Full Frame / Vista Vision\
    * Super 35mm (Standard)\
    * APS-C (Sony, Nikon, Fuji)\
    * APS-C Canon (Factor 1.6x)\
    * Micro Four Thirds (MFT)\
    * 1-inch Sensor (Drones Pro, Sony ZV-1)\
    * 1/1.7-inch (Action Cams High-end)\
    * 1/2.3-inch (GoPro, Drones Std)\
    * 1/3-inch (Smartphones)\
* **Base de Datos F\'edlmica:**\
